  "meaning": "Strength order (backing result): if the selected relation restricted to actual concreta is well-founded at w, the nonempty actual roster is not a borrowing trap: by induction on accessibility, no actual concretum belongs to a trap, because each trap member has an actual concrete ground that is again a trap member. Same profile, selected relation and world; constructive, no excluded middle. Whole-roster nontrapping concerns only the whole roster, well-foundedness every descending chain: a roster with a root and an infinite descending chain beside it satisfies the weak version and not the strong one (not model-certified in this slice).",
